    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's like the story is just... finished. there's no more chapters to write because the protagonist is gone. i keep waiting for some kind of redemption arc or a new purpose to show up, but it never does. it just feels like i'm dragging around a corpse that's still breathing. do you think it's even possible to start over when the main part of you is already dead?",
